#. ja: クエスト「澄み輝ける改良計画」にて入手できる主道具は、<br>現在のクラス「<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>」のモーエンツールとなります。<br>「澄み輝ける改良計画」を「<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>」で受注しますか？
#. de: Möchtest du diesen Auftrag als <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0> annehmen und das Mowen-Werkzeug für diese Charakterklasse verbessern?
#. fr: Si vous commencez la quête “Plus qu'un outil, un symbole” maintenant, l'outil des merveilles que vous pourrez améliorer sera celui <if ($gn4 == 0)><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 2></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if>.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row), column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/048/AktKct302_04803:TEXT_AKTKCT302_04803_SYSTEM_000_001:1"
msgid "Please note that upon completing the quest “A Tool for the Ages,” you will receive an upgraded splendorous tool for your current class of <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>."
msgstr "Обратите внимание: за выполнение задания «Инструмент на века» вы получите улучшенный инструмент для вашего текущего класса или профессии «<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>»."

#. ja: <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>のモーエンツールを改良しますか？
#. de: Den Auftrag als <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0> annehmen?
#. fr: Voulez-vous améliorer l'outil <if ($gn4 == 0)><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 2></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if><nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/048/AktKct302_04803:TEXT_AKTKCT302_04803_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "Что вы будете делать?"

#. ja: もう少し悩んでみる
#. de: Ich überleg's mir noch einmal.
#. fr: Non
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/048/AktKct302_04803:TEXT_AKTKCT302_04803_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "Undertake this quest as another class."
msgstr "Выполнить задание другим классом."

#. ja: <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0>のモーエンツールを改良する
#. de: Ja, los geht's!
#. fr: Oui
#. speaker: A1
#. macro: <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 68 (the player's current class or job, a ClassJob row) == 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
